<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1915</h1><p class="ref-lede">1915 in world history: 46 events, 15 births, 15 deaths, 4 states founded and 2 that came to an end. 741 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
